;;---------------- ---------------- ------------ ------------ ------------ ------------ --------
C_ADV            CIRCULAR         1 0 0 0        1
C_OK             CIRCULAR         1 0 0 0        1
OR1              CIRCULAR         0.5 0 0 0        1
W1               RECT_OPEN        1 2 0 0        1

[LOSSES]
